STATUS-BADGE faithfulness: the web maps an invitation's status onto a vehicle-status
dot for `StatusBadge` (pending→'online', revoked→'offline', else→'asleep') and renders
that mapped word capitalized with the matching dot color. VehicleAccessInvitationStatus
reproduces this exactly (label "Online"/"Offline"/"Asleep"; tone success/danger/neutral
= the vehicle FSM online/offline/asleep dot tints — web/src/types/fsm/vehicle.ts).

